 "body": "This PR adds missing build path entries to the Java Eclipse IDE specific `.classpath` files, effectively resolving all compile errors in the project. An outdated license file for jmdns was also updated in the process.\r\nThe changes in this PR only affect people who use Java Eclipse to build this project.\r\n\r\nThis resolves issue https://github.com/arduino/Arduino/issues/5459.",
